<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai Ind shrs rise on warrant talk.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Ind shrs rise on warrant talk.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd rose on Wednesday on talk of a covered warrant issue on the stock, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue size of the warrants is expected to be 84.9 million warrants,&quot; said one dealing manager at a regional brokerage. Traders said gearing ratio was expected to be four times with a premium of 24.98 percent.</p>
<p>The shares were up HK$0.80 at HK$25.50 in late trade after hitting an all time high of HK$25.55 per share.</p>
<p>Volume was 7.13 million shares worth HK$179.53 million.</p>
